.TH NN-PROFILE 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-profile \- per-operator runtime profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn profile [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Time operators when the backend can profile (reference). Other backends may report overall latency only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-backend NAME
Runtime backend.
.TP
.B \-\-input FILE
Input tensor.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 7 if backend cannot profile.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn profile model.onnx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-benchmark(1), nn-ops(1)
